reach plugin

The agent-reach skill and its references/ are copied verbatim from Agent Reach
(github.com/Panniantong/Agent-Reach, MIT License, Copyright (c) Neo Reid; see LICENSE).
The copy is refreshed from the engine's agent_reach/skill/ by a sync script and checked
for drift by a test; do not edit it here.

The plugin does not bundle the agent-reach program or any upstream tool (yt-dlp, gh, ...).
They are installed on the user's machine, only when the user approves.
